---
import BaseHead from '../../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE } from '../../consts';
import '../../styles/academic-project.css';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={`VectorScribe | ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="My software engineering work at VectorScribe: Python control software, image processing, and deployment for laser holographic microprinting." />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main class="professional-project">
			<div class="project-header">
				<p class="project-context">Software Engineer · August 2025 - Present</p>
				<div class="company-heading">
					<img src="/assets/images/projects/vectorscribe-logo.png" alt="VectorScribe logo" width="556" height="376" />
					<h1>VectorScribe</h1>
				</div>
				<p class="subtitle">Python software for controlling laser holographic microprinters, from configuring print patterns to executing hardware routines.</p>
				<p class="project-context">VectorScribe, LLC · Bethlehem, PA</p>

				<a href="https://www.vector-scribe.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="project-link">Visit VectorScribe’s Website &rarr;</a>
			</div>

			<section class="prose glass-card">
				<h2>My Work</h2>
				<p>I consolidated legacy Python codebases into one control platform supporting multiple printer generations. Refactoring image-processing algorithms and optimizing hardware-control routines substantially reduced print execution time.</p>
				<p>I also designed and deployed a custom interface for configuring print patterns and hardware parameters, and established the company’s GitHub organization and lab deployment pipelines to streamline collaboration.</p>
			</section>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	.company-heading {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 1rem;
	}
	.company-heading img {
		width: 96px;
		height: auto;
	}
	.company-heading h1 {
		margin: 0;
	}
</style>
